{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-12-12 23:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING DONATES $300,000 TO ASSIST INDONESIAN EARTHQUAKE RELIEF EFFORTS', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA. , DEC. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOEING COMPANY [NYSE: BA] TODAY ANNOUNCED A $300,000 DONATION (EQUIVALENT TO IDR 4.6 BILLION) FROM THE BOEING CHARITABLE TRUST TO ASSIST THOSE WHO HAVE BEEN IMPACTED BY THE RECENT INDONESIAN EARTHQUAKE.'}